  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two blocks with masses <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_1\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_2\"></span> are connected by a light string and placed on a frictionless horizontal surface. A horizontal force of magnitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> is applied to the block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_2\"></span> as shown in the diagram.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the tension <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> in the string?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = F\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = \\frac{m_1}{m_1 + m_2}F\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = \\frac{m_2}{m_1 + m_2}F\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = \\frac{m_1 + m_2}{m_2}F\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
